{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "e5cc6d3c6a66fea2eb28257c6d6b92c24152d87eb3eea94b37cb9f8f2bae073e",
  "bundle_request_count": 19,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:23883bc1ccf01252f5024dff2833d7fb5f17ce9f3a39db46b9a3082f7bd592be",
      "request_id": "23883bc1ccf01252f5024dff2833d7fb5f17ce9f3a39db46b9a3082f7bd592be",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "877bc6293adee50590d8837ffd89ce53",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这之后，规矩终于改了：二零一九年，温网启用决胜盘十二平抢七；澳网走得更远，决胜盘六平之后直接抢十。二零二二年，四大满贯统一：决胜盘打到六比六，抢十定胜负，领先两分。打不完的比赛，从规则上被判了死刑。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "93aac652521723bbf0a6748635cd33eb4f5a1a7ed2e412653ac701773a94d6c7",
      "words_sha256": "486a2585ea5bfff4dfa3d7f5b320920c9c823a22b28765476ed588c779a0deb8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:27c0e9d4ad5d584cd3020bcced812601009b83e0401f96b5d042b32aa1d7f06e",
      "request_id": "27c0e9d4ad5d584cd3020bcced812601009b83e0401f96b5d042b32aa1d7f06e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8e5716e8b16631c333a1eb7f29e42375",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "抢七，是被一场打不完的比赛逼出来的。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "030b229697478f4d6913ce5f885c286708717136255b0b823f8f5d47d500deab",
      "words_sha256": "d020e3383549ebcbb73f1836ff8ba61ede8ee0ea6d49692d6117cd87f83d64e8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:28b5a74120d7a8df8445651b371823e40fcc66af125b4b9b095b79f961b5914b",
      "request_id": "28b5a74120d7a8df8445651b371823e40fcc66af125b4b9b095b79f961b5914b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "90bee0cf152e1fe5464bc11a0ce515a9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "而抢十最有名的一场，就是开头那场。二零二四年澳网，布林科娃对莱巴金娜。决胜盘抢十打到二十二比二十，她错过九个赛点，又救了六个赛点。四十二分，三分钟——不对，三十一分钟，才决出胜负。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ee73744a0b0026c64b75abcf8ad2bbfbbb92ecd942d431a8b72afa40134270b2",
      "words_sha256": "5069d31adff8efcbdc78697234b739717a030153564a8732627e724167c9dd8a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:314214bd5cee05f2b53b98d83d8809c0fb051a3642c7197da8fc22bf175c00ef",
      "request_id": "314214bd5cee05f2b53b98d83d8809c0fb051a3642c7197da8fc22bf175c00ef",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0f0860cbc26ec4a900a395ed65df9760",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "他力推的版本叫突然死亡，其实就是今天抢七的骨架。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "94f3fb2acee469db84885e745d06fdc0663ecbdd85d9755d1927a3a191c1ec8d",
      "words_sha256": "9367297fa402adfd17dff8e1f2538c94db56b12d21eb92959094b24f030d64ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4d2dfebc4d6c7f1865a0a28e1d27c12855c2c46bde0d48424c361455a5e9b52b",
      "request_id": "4d2dfebc4d6c7f1865a0a28e1d27c12855c2c46bde0d48424c361455a5e9b52b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3ed4b7823dbf739ce786134819737af2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "球员和观众都爱这个版本：够狠、够快。可拉沃他们几个大牌偏说不行，赢两分才算赢球，这是网球的规矩。于是有了第二个版本：先到七分、领先两分。范·阿伦气坏了，给它起名叫久拖之死。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5a6af8259d5670b53ff6dc36aaf6f9d5f69af3ccdf351a70929300cab5b57b44",
      "words_sha256": "dd392784e6690b4742c7936e850cf3a95babefc87bafe72d4a8394c4e4de6fa7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:58cb0b36c7d973769931a577bf2c8b229745c1646a817cd9cec114ea47bf832f",
      "request_id": "58cb0b36c7d973769931a577bf2c8b229745c1646a817cd9cec114ea47bf832f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f0c8cd2650cd06fa783b9bfcb1341a55",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这一分，她们打了三十一分钟还没打完。这已经是网球最快的决胜方式了。抢七被发明出来，就是为了让比赛赶紧结束。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3e2bd60adb53bb4b1e7b3bf9da385605e7aedaa59f8be981d0fe9fce96e42071",
      "words_sha256": "98c1474dc883d70ac69725473b14fcbb0421feee422ef4954362b8271e88c235"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5e49bfb9fa8db7cbe58c52d3e6c3cbd8d6910c364f00bc786c5b130884dd610e",
      "request_id": "5e49bfb9fa8db7cbe58c52d3e6c3cbd8d6910c364f00bc786c5b130884dd610e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6265c1009fdb37104510d44b030f343c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "局分六比六之后，不再一局一局打，改打一个小局定胜负。小局里先到五分就赢。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "9e5187c54985448235fb294f382f55628b0886b25dc904db0a01b0ef750d293a",
      "words_sha256": "71cf506375137a80fc6c95b07eb89823d58559e0708d65d188c1ea6d412b06b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:620e0d6500c0c4d25650983de7a5b51080bd4532e215cdfdf4ab9a6ef5f64346",
      "request_id": "620e0d6500c0c4d25650983de7a5b51080bd4532e215cdfdf4ab9a6ef5f64346",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8d751151beb4b47951be21a59a9d890f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最狠的一条是：打到四比四，最后一分定生死，接发球的人还能选从哪边接。也就是说，这一分可能是发球方的赛点，也可能是接发方的赛点——双赛点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "91e15b6fd83070858dc9b54955bd9c40ed70f3911ee590cc91ec1061077010d7",
      "words_sha256": "9d669699614e9213e3c9859a4ced52fe3aa9699c5db7fc0db41f087f6a6d6c04"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9089685b07778f44fc27fe60437bdb446bc38628b5f71400f45cff1c31427bdf",
      "request_id": "9089685b07778f44fc27fe60437bdb446bc38628b5f71400f45cff1c31427bdf",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bd8a0d7aa0386fd9f7874e4bebb5eb5f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "四年后的一九八零年温网决赛，博格对麦肯罗。第四盘抢七，网球史上最著名的一个：博格先拿到冠军点，麦肯罗救了；麦肯罗拿到盘点，博格又顶住。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ab28d533ebd6f33879a3a76d8fb1500c883a1be4601bb87441304a3e2c7637d8",
      "words_sha256": "60d8130443c52c83644a111d46bbde66ed3901c20a7dd8cebf8c56bb5855aad3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9356f151327eb0dac7213571b9ea42e96c97919415604e7704a906c90fdc4372",
      "request_id": "9356f151327eb0dac7213571b9ea42e96c97919415604e7704a906c90fdc4372",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "183c96aebe98074be75c7981e5b07ecc",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "记分牌被打到没法显示，两个人最后是站着合影的。整场十一个小时五分钟，跨了三天。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "50cb04ba03a6bdaa517aee12e9789df81c1e6ad06f736a2b701b5b8fe89e26b5",
      "words_sha256": "74099f10e32d16f36cd488a85f20af76dfe65a44caa87ad1d2fc0f6e46f49e17"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:97bedccedcf5d63968ef01bc9ac97c11214ab98a97e9746180ebd5ec936678f5",
      "request_id": "97bedccedcf5d63968ef01bc9ac97c11214ab98a97e9746180ebd5ec936678f5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d846653e5056aefc63b783366776e061",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "范·阿伦拿出了他的方案。一九六五年，他自掏腰包，在纽波特办了场试验赛，请拉沃、罗斯维尔这些大牌来试新计分。可他没想到，真正救网球的，是他最看不上的那个版本。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "4695ebb89240a5db9c56ee6f3f760b17e3323e817009883f0b105096bdb0e5cb",
      "words_sha256": "156b12279e5d9093eb2721264b77c0cbc5834f142a4841d7fc84494b522de640"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:aff8d006a75f242b5e6032f6adf8e8011f98652d550697010d41b575cd9606d5",
      "request_id": "aff8d006a75f242b5e6032f6adf8e8011f98652d550697010d41b575cd9606d5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "090a0714cb493d56c9ac8c87afe97363",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "发明它的人叫吉米·范·阿伦，美国人，网球名人堂就是他创办的。这个人有个执念：网球什么都好，就是打不完。一场势均力敌的比赛，能从下午打到天黑，第二天接着打。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7d63acb17c76cafceccf463e0bbfb1bc2c14738a41fa44d96f4ee80beb1280c6",
      "words_sha256": "3aff4cdc569bbd78df82239c05a4a99d2ed20341876618e307a7918f8b5bef10"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f538ba882508d606e6d0694a6c517c166dc225a682361bedc382c128258133db",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ba547d416f1c84bc06d28ad0de3bac1a021ebeaed68a3d777f2434002ce93512",
      "request_id": "ba547d416f1c84bc06d28ad0de3bac1a021ebeaed68a3d777f2434002ce93512",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "239bae326391ea7e73e5631fdcdf60f5",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "五小时十二分，跨了两天，还没分出胜负。所有人都看明白了：这么打下去，电视别排期了，球员先累死在场上。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ac0afabfd709ac20d62ff71497a4fbecf09a6ebad882c67805dac45190acb4df",
      "words_sha256": "c01c54de1c15479ba85480a6d56b5679efe6b4c74b223fe5d77655e4f026895d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c01b39519cc626d571b9431ecba85538ca326dd51d636d1911614c010bd44f48",
      "request_id": "c01b39519cc626d571b9431ecba85538ca326dd51d636d1911614c010bd44f48",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "cc5843b9be663705c7cbefdb29df79a1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "你数一下：麦肯罗在这一个抢七里，救了五个冠军点，自己浪费了七个盘点，最后十八比十六拿下。整个抢七打了二十分钟，全场起立。可博格第五盘还是八比六赢了，五连冠到手。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "52901e2ac061c9fabbfb927591cad41acffd993ca31cb4a81861a3fcdcd7b4dd",
      "words_sha256": "53b5c97b7529c04e8ba8bee2fdebf38a3e03fa8244fab8053aa1febb26edbafd"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:cb479f86421ec3a565e39ab326494510a2156d85359047b3caaf8f79b48b6339",
      "request_id": "cb479f86421ec3a565e39ab326494510a2156d85359047b3caaf8f79b48b6339",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ee212643b288473c9243eb61390e8077",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "比赛在两个版本之间摇摆了几年。一九七零年美网第一次用上抢七，升起红旗，全场就知道：决胜负的时候到了。赛事总监塔尔伯特把话说透了：球员不买票，买票的是观众。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8b7664680fb04a49061e276ca358add0d302d9483614b558290d3687a073ea21",
      "words_sha256": "2feb4f8c8619b2cfa96caf7b6ae27af3afad138dfc6c944e8daf5300eba64c44"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:dad972487a0fa6edcb4867b4404a962b817559f4418b83026ead1dde611d0086",
      "request_id": "dad972487a0fa6edcb4867b4404a962b817559f4418b83026ead1dde611d0086",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b387c41c7ed9c7a0c9d8388813e0fc32",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "抢七七十三年。从红旗升起的突然死亡，到二十二比二十的抢十，它救了网球的排期，没救得了网球的争论。决胜盘抢十，你觉得是进步，还是网球丢掉了它最后的浪漫？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7ca4174c2b75887f5d0d9ef3548746eb6997fe4ea57e71260d95da89a1027b88",
      "words_sha256": "5b805efb22a085d2d250f7b2d631a9a69a3781c2d0370bcea7ec270846f8f0b1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:dbfc9247cb76f718b031c0b804b4873b300a4e72676a21df003d9bed69587b5d",
      "request_id": "dbfc9247cb76f718b031c0b804b4873b300a4e72676a21df003d9bed69587b5d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "295a6a4e217438909c87146c84fb3202",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "抢七治好了拖延症，可它治不了一个地方：决胜盘。很长一段时间，四大满贯的决胜盘不设抢七，必须领先两局。一场球最极端的样子，出现在二零一零年温网：伊斯内尔对马胡特，决胜盘打到七十比六十八。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ae9f782c2194f06c9f26d9e139bbe2324cbc61c2e92c57d7bf669d383fded10a",
      "words_sha256": "32fd16b965a6b46a8b8cd3cb5ec8785496651fe6832f99a67054eec182cbd478"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e7a3935cec200e51bf2db252e04a2dad62d3c2fbcecd9a7ce101aa9936a19298",
      "request_id": "e7a3935cec200e51bf2db252e04a2dad62d3c2fbcecd9a7ce101aa9936a19298",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "49e98eed04d9ff37c5a6e815b26442af",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一九六九年温网，四十一岁的冈萨雷斯和帕萨雷尔，打了一场一百一十二局的比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1a976206d6d98c41533ce1d5efa864e4af4b0f4f1766f381a051f83778a07a58",
      "words_sha256": "4c19b1e1749ab9ba152a4d2e17bc2e00c920e87caa2449555df15e0720d1d5aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "3e2bd60adb53bb4b1e7b3bf9da385605e7aedaa59f8be981d0fe9fce96e42071",
      "words_sha256": "98c1474dc883d70ac69725473b14fcbb0421feee422ef4954362b8271e88c235",
      "words_path": "voice_01.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f0c8cd2650cd06fa783b9bfcb1341a55",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这一分，她们打了三十一分钟还没打完。这已经是网球最快的决胜方式了。抢七被发明出来，就是为了让比赛赶紧结束。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7d63acb17c76cafceccf463e0bbfb1bc2c14738a41fa44d96f4ee80beb1280c6",
      "words_sha256": "3aff4cdc569bbd78df82239c05a4a99d2ed20341876618e307a7918f8b5bef10",
      "words_path": "voice_02.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "090a0714cb493d56c9ac8c87afe97363",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "发明它的人叫吉米·范·阿伦，美国人，网球名人堂就是他创办的。这个人有个执念：网球什么都好，就是打不完。一场势均力敌的比赛，能从下午打到天黑，第二天接着打。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "1a976206d6d98c41533ce1d5efa864e4af4b0f4f1766f381a051f83778a07a58",
      "words_sha256": "4c19b1e1749ab9ba152a4d2e17bc2e00c920e87caa2449555df15e0720d1d5aa",
      "words_path": "voice_03.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "49e98eed04d9ff37c5a6e815b26442af",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一九六九年温网，四十一岁的冈萨雷斯和帕萨雷尔，打了一场一百一十二局的比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ac0afabfd709ac20d62ff71497a4fbecf09a6ebad882c67805dac45190acb4df",
      "words_sha256": "c01c54de1c15479ba85480a6d56b5679efe6b4c74b223fe5d77655e4f026895d",
      "words_path": "voice_04.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "239bae326391ea7e73e5631fdcdf60f5",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "五小时十二分，跨了两天，还没分出胜负。所有人都看明白了：这么打下去，电视别排期了，球员先累死在场上。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "4695ebb89240a5db9c56ee6f3f760b17e3323e817009883f0b105096bdb0e5cb",
      "words_sha256": "156b12279e5d9093eb2721264b77c0cbc5834f142a4841d7fc84494b522de640",
      "words_path": "voice_05.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d846653e5056aefc63b783366776e061",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "范·阿伦拿出了他的方案。一九六五年，他自掏腰包，在纽波特办了场试验赛，请拉沃、罗斯维尔这些大牌来试新计分。可他没想到，真正救网球的，是他最看不上的那个版本。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "94f3fb2acee469db84885e745d06fdc0663ecbdd85d9755d1927a3a191c1ec8d",
      "words_sha256": "9367297fa402adfd17dff8e1f2538c94db56b12d21eb92959094b24f030d64ad",
      "words_path": "voice_06.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0f0860cbc26ec4a900a395ed65df9760",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "他力推的版本叫突然死亡，其实就是今天抢七的骨架。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "9e5187c54985448235fb294f382f55628b0886b25dc904db0a01b0ef750d293a",
      "words_sha256": "71cf506375137a80fc6c95b07eb89823d58559e0708d65d188c1ea6d412b06b7",
      "words_path": "voice_07.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6265c1009fdb37104510d44b030f343c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "局分六比六之后，不再一局一局打，改打一个小局定胜负。小局里先到五分就赢。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "91e15b6fd83070858dc9b54955bd9c40ed70f3911ee590cc91ec1061077010d7",
      "words_sha256": "9d669699614e9213e3c9859a4ced52fe3aa9699c5db7fc0db41f087f6a6d6c04",
      "words_path": "voice_08.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8d751151beb4b47951be21a59a9d890f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最狠的一条是：打到四比四，最后一分定生死，接发球的人还能选从哪边接。也就是说，这一分可能是发球方的赛点，也可能是接发方的赛点——双赛点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5a6af8259d5670b53ff6dc36aaf6f9d5f69af3ccdf351a70929300cab5b57b44",
      "words_sha256": "dd392784e6690b4742c7936e850cf3a95babefc87bafe72d4a8394c4e4de6fa7",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3ed4b7823dbf739ce786134819737af2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "球员和观众都爱这个版本：够狠、够快。可拉沃他们几个大牌偏说不行，赢两分才算赢球，这是网球的规矩。于是有了第二个版本：先到七分、领先两分。范·阿伦气坏了，给它起名叫久拖之死。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8b7664680fb04a49061e276ca358add0d302d9483614b558290d3687a073ea21",
      "words_sha256": "2feb4f8c8619b2cfa96caf7b6ae27af3afad138dfc6c944e8daf5300eba64c44",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ee212643b288473c9243eb61390e8077",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "比赛在两个版本之间摇摆了几年。一九七零年美网第一次用上抢七，升起红旗，全场就知道：决胜负的时候到了。赛事总监塔尔伯特把话说透了：球员不买票，买票的是观众。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ab28d533ebd6f33879a3a76d8fb1500c883a1be4601bb87441304a3e2c7637d8",
      "words_sha256": "60d8130443c52c83644a111d46bbde66ed3901c20a7dd8cebf8c56bb5855aad3",
      "words_path": "voice_11.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bd8a0d7aa0386fd9f7874e4bebb5eb5f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "四年后的一九八零年温网决赛，博格对麦肯罗。第四盘抢七，网球史上最著名的一个：博格先拿到冠军点，麦肯罗救了；麦肯罗拿到盘点，博格又顶住。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "52901e2ac061c9fabbfb927591cad41acffd993ca31cb4a81861a3fcdcd7b4dd",
      "words_sha256": "53b5c97b7529c04e8ba8bee2fdebf38a3e03fa8244fab8053aa1febb26edbafd",
      "words_path": "voice_14.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "cc5843b9be663705c7cbefdb29df79a1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "你数一下：麦肯罗在这一个抢七里，救了五个冠军点，自己浪费了七个盘点，最后十八比十六拿下。整个抢七打了二十分钟，全场起立。可博格第五盘还是八比六赢了，五连冠到手。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ae9f782c2194f06c9f26d9e139bbe2324cbc61c2e92c57d7bf669d383fded10a",
      "words_sha256": "32fd16b965a6b46a8b8cd3cb5ec8785496651fe6832f99a67054eec182cbd478",
      "words_path": "voice_15.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "295a6a4e217438909c87146c84fb3202",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "抢七治好了拖延症，可它治不了一个地方：决胜盘。很长一段时间，四大满贯的决胜盘不设抢七，必须领先两局。一场球最极端的样子，出现在二零一零年温网：伊斯内尔对马胡特，决胜盘打到七十比六十八。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "50cb04ba03a6bdaa517aee12e9789df81c1e6ad06f736a2b701b5b8fe89e26b5",
      "words_sha256": "74099f10e32d16f36cd488a85f20af76dfe65a44caa87ad1d2fc0f6e46f49e17",
      "words_path": "voice_17.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "183c96aebe98074be75c7981e5b07ecc",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "记分牌被打到没法显示，两个人最后是站着合影的。整场十一个小时五分钟，跨了三天。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "93aac652521723bbf0a6748635cd33eb4f5a1a7ed2e412653ac701773a94d6c7",
      "words_sha256": "486a2585ea5bfff4dfa3d7f5b320920c9c823a22b28765476ed588c779a0deb8",
      "words_path": "voice_19.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "877bc6293adee50590d8837ffd89ce53",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这之后，规矩终于改了：二零一九年，温网启用决胜盘十二平抢七；澳网走得更远，决胜盘六平之后直接抢十。二零二二年，四大满贯统一：决胜盘打到六比六，抢十定胜负，领先两分。打不完的比赛，从规则上被判了死刑。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ee73744a0b0026c64b75abcf8ad2bbfbbb92ecd942d431a8b72afa40134270b2",
      "words_sha256": "5069d31adff8efcbdc78697234b739717a030153564a8732627e724167c9dd8a",
      "words_path": "voice_20.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "90bee0cf152e1fe5464bc11a0ce515a9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "而抢十最有名的一场，就是开头那场。二零二四年澳网，布林科娃对莱巴金娜。决胜盘抢十打到二十二比二十，她错过九个赛点，又救了六个赛点。四十二分，三分钟——不对，三十一分钟，才决出胜负。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7ca4174c2b75887f5d0d9ef3548746eb6997fe4ea57e71260d95da89a1027b88",
      "words_sha256": "5b805efb22a085d2d250f7b2d631a9a69a3781c2d0370bcea7ec270846f8f0b1",
      "words_path": "voice_24.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b387c41c7ed9c7a0c9d8388813e0fc32",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "抢七七十三年。从红旗升起的突然死亡，到二十二比二十的抢十，它救了网球的排期，没救得了网球的争论。决胜盘抢十，你觉得是进步，还是网球丢掉了它最后的浪漫？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_cover.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "030b229697478f4d6913ce5f885c286708717136255b0b823f8f5d47d500deab",
      "words_sha256": "d020e3383549ebcbb73f1836ff8ba61ede8ee0ea6d49692d6117cd87f83d64e8",
      "words_path": "voice_cover.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8e5716e8b16631c333a1eb7f29e42375",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "抢七，是被一场打不完的比赛逼出来的。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_outro.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f538ba882508d606e6d0694a6c517c166dc225a682361bedc382c128258133db",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8",
      "words_path": "voice_outro.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    }
  ]
}
